@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Benutzer registrieren
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2. Benutzer anmelden (Login)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Token aus Login-Response speichern
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Eigenes Profil abrufen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Manifest abgleichen (Sync-Plan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/manifest
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "fileName": "test.txt",
    "relativePath": "test.txt",
    "size": 13,
    "sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-18T10:00:00Z",
    "lastModified": "2026-10-18T10:00:00Z",
    "changeState": "New"
  }
]

### 5. Datei hochladen
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello SQLite!
--boundary--

### 6. Datei herunterladen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/download?filePath=test.txt
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Datei löschen
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/delete?filePath=test.txt
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Abmelden (Logout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}